      en: ["Accessible only by boat via the Usumacinta River", "Famous for its finely carved stone lintels", "Reached its peak under the ruler Shield Jaguar II", "Structure 19 is known as the Labyrinth due to its passages", "Maintained strategic control over Maya river trade", "Contains the largest number of inscribed monuments in the region"],
